WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:15.900
Roxy landed in Metro City Park.

2
00:00:15.901 --> 00:00:19.039
"It's Rocket Girl!" cried Mara.

3
00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:20.810
Roxy looked around.

4
00:00:20.811 --> 00:00:24.320
Monster dogs and cats were everywhere!

5
00:00:24.321 --> 00:00:27.272
Several monster pets were on the tennis court.

6
00:00:27.273 --> 00:00:30.199
The court was surrounded by a tall fence.

7
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:33.648
A monster cat hissed at a man selling balloons.

8
00:00:33.649 --> 00:00:36.366
The cat jumped up and stuck out its claws.

9
00:00:36.367 --> 00:00:38.443
Pop! Pop! Pop!

10
00:00:38.444 --> 00:00:40.920
The cat popped all the balloons.

11
00:00:40.921 --> 00:00:47.682
"My balloons are ruined!" cried the balloon man.

12
00:00:47.683 --> 00:00:52.377
Roxy noticed the cat's collar. It was glowing.

13
00:00:52.378 --> 00:00:54.675
"MEOW!"

14
00:00:54.676 --> 00:00:56.470
Roxy spun around.

15
00:00:56.471 --> 00:00:59.139
Another monster cat was creeping toward her!

16
00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:05.591
Roxy gasped. "It has a glowing collar too!"

17
00:01:05.592 --> 00:01:09.942
Phwoof! The cat shot a flaming hairball toward Roxy.

18
00:01:09.943 --> 00:01:13.080
Roxy made a fist and—bam!

19
00:01:13.081 --> 00:01:15.424
She knocked the hairball away.

20
00:01:15.425 --> 00:01:18.404
"Help, Rocket Girl!" cried Terrell.

21
00:01:18.404 --> 00:01:21.106
Roxy glanced back at her friends.

22
00:01:21.107 --> 00:01:25.663
Two monster dogs were growling and moving toward them!

23
00:01:25.664 --> 00:01:27.711
Roxy whistled loudly.

24
00:01:27.712 --> 00:01:30.674
The dogs turned and charged toward Roxy.

25
00:01:30.675 --> 00:01:34.680
She ran to the tennis court and stood in front of the open gate.

26
00:01:34.681 --> 00:01:39.174
"GRR!" The dogs growled and raced toward Roxy.

27
00:01:39.175 --> 00:01:41.888
Just before they reached her, she jumped up.

28
00:01:41.889 --> 00:01:46.418
The dogs tumbled onto the tennis court.

29
00:01:46.419 --> 00:01:49.565
"Ha!" cried Roxy as she slammed shut the gate.

30
00:01:49.566 --> 00:01:53.296
Terrell, Mara, and Jack cheered.

31
00:01:53.297 --> 00:01:57.108
"Yay, Rocket Girl!" cried Mara.

32
00:01:57.109 --> 00:02:01.067
Roxy zoomed into the air.

33
00:02:01.068 --> 00:02:06.249
"Those glowing collars must be turning pets into monsters," she thought.

34
00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:11.124
"Ralphie's owner said she got the glowing collar from Mr. Snippy.

35
00:02:11.125 --> 00:02:14.400
But where is Mr. Snippy's Pet Salon?"

36
00:02:14.401 --> 00:02:17.790
Just then a man yelled, "Bad dog, Buster!"

37
00:02:17.791 --> 00:02:20.279
Roxy looked down.

38
00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:22.500
The man was missing a shoe.

39
00:02:22.501 --> 00:02:25.395
He was wagging a finger at a monster dog.

40
00:02:25.396 --> 00:02:29.006
The dog was chewing on something as his collar glowed.

41
00:02:29.007 --> 00:02:31.329
Roxy flew down to the man.

42
00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:34.843
"Excuse me. Is this your dog?"

43
00:02:34.844 --> 00:02:36.801
"Yes," said the man.

44
00:02:36.802 --> 00:02:41.463
"And he's very bad! He just ate my shoe!"

45
00:02:41.464 --> 00:02:46.003
"Did you get that collar from Mr. Snippy's Pet Salon?"

46
00:02:46.004 --> 00:02:48.457
"Yes." The man looked surprised.

47
00:02:48.458 --> 00:02:50.293
"How did you know?"

48
00:02:50.294 --> 00:02:52.580
"Never mind," said Roxy.

49
00:02:52.581 --> 00:02:55.011
"Just tell me where the salon is."

50
00:02:55.012 --> 00:02:58.533
The man told Roxy the salon's address.

51
00:02:58.534 --> 00:03:01.143
Roxy zipped through the air again.

52
00:03:01.144 --> 00:03:05.426
A moment later she threw open the salon's doors.

53
00:03:05.427 --> 00:03:08.506
A thin man with a bowtie spun around.

54
00:03:08.507 --> 00:03:11.390
He wore gloves with sharp blades.

55
00:03:11.397 --> 00:03:15.801
When he saw Roxy, his lips curled into a nasty smile.

56
00:03:15.802 --> 00:03:19.272
"Welcome to Mr. Snippy's, Rocket Girl!"

57
00:03:19.273 --> 00:03:21.846
His sharp blades clacked loudly.

58
00:03:21.847 --> 00:03:27.642
"I suppose you're here for a cut!"
